  "bio": "Alex De Pase is a highly experienced tattoo artist, highly recognized in the sphere of 'realism' tattoo style that proves his extraordinary skillset. Located in Udine, Italy, he garnered a massive following around 115K on Instagram, a testament to his exceptional talent. As the owner of @dermalizepro, director @mitaudine, and being sponsored by major brands like @intenzetattooink and @cheyenne_tattooequipment, Alex De Pase exemplifies true professionalism.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Udine, Friuli-venezia Giulia, Italy\n\nOwner @dermalizepro                  ADP stores\nMind & co-organizer @icons_and_prodigies \nAlways faithful: @intenzetattooink \nITF’s President",
